Contributions are made under `.github/CONTRIBUTING.md`; do not contribute if you
cannot grant the rights it describes.

## 7. Termination and Remedies

Sections 3, 4, and 5 are conditions of your rights. If you breach a condition,
your rights end automatically, without notice. For any other breach,
PT NAKAFA TEKNO KREATIF may give written notice, and your rights end if you do
not cure the breach within 30 days after it. Where copyright or another right
protects a use, using it after your rights end is infringement.

When your rights end, you must stop using Nakafa, delete every copy, fork,
clone, mirror, deployment, recording, and post under your control within two
business days, except copies you must keep to comply with law, and confirm the
deletion in writing when PT NAKAFA TEKNO KREATIF asks.

PT NAKAFA TEKNO KREATIF may seek every remedy the law allows, including
takedowns, injunctions, damages, and the value of any Benefit obtained through
the breach. Only PT NAKAFA TEKNO KREATIF can reinstate your rights, and only by
written permission. Sections 5 and 7 to 14 continue after your rights end.

